      "id": "claim_782f5c688c8e4ef3b40c035ccc04f59a",
      "statement": "load_context loads the active trip snapshot through the owner-scoped TripService and stores trip context, instructions, profile and preferences in plain state fields rather than appending a SystemMessage to messages.",
