      "id": "claim_96a59b5e76d54757968e2aaf38196ace",
      "statement": "An unknown intent or a tier-gated target ends the turn with a localized code-authored reply, and because the plan node is only reachable through the supervisor's routing branch, the tier gate also blocks free users from the booking HITL path.",
