      "id": "claim_cc2daed71a2745b78112f010f09e5e46",
      "statement": "Supervisor slot normalization happens in code: unresolvable or ambiguous date text is dropped rather than guessed, non-positive adult/room counts are dropped while zero children is kept, and only resolved keys are emitted as trip_facts because an absent key means no update.",
