    {
      "id": "claim_474253fd3ded4183b07db4a5572f7e74",
      "statement": "The supervisor builds the task list in code: primary intent first, follow-ons deduplicated and filtered against booking and the tier allow-list, capped at MAX_LEDGER_STEPS (4), and a booking target always yields exactly one task with no follow-ons.",
