      "id": "claim_be79b41a22424a64946edbf32afd98a7",
      "statement": "route_tasks returns END when there are no tasks, 'plan' when the first task is booking, the specialist node name for a single task, and a list of Send('synthesis_worker', {**state, 'task': t}) for multiple tasks because Send does not merge parent state into the worker input.",
